  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACGF - Partnership fund with ADB to provide Technical Assistance Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the ACGF, Technical Assistance will support ASEAN governments to identify, design, and prepare commercially viable green infrastructure or other development projects. It provides upstream analysis, policy and regulatory support, capacity-building, and innovative finance interventions to de-risk investments and help mobilise public and private capital.</narrative>
  </description>
